# Performance Optimization

## ⚡ **Database Performance**
- Optimize database queries and use proper indexing
- Implement caching strategies where appropriate
- Use eager loading to prevent N+1 query problems
- Implement proper pagination for large datasets
- Use database transactions appropriately
- Monitor slow queries and optimize them
- Use database connection pooling when applicable

## 🌐 **Frontend Performance**
- Minimize HTTP requests and optimize asset delivery
- Use lazy loading for images and heavy resources
- Implement proper asset bundling and minification
- Use CDNs for static assets when possible
- Optimize JavaScript execution and avoid blocking operations
- Implement proper caching headers
- Use modern image formats (WebP, AVIF) when possible

## 🚀 **Backend Performance**
- Implement proper memory management and avoid memory leaks
- Use efficient algorithms and data structures
- Profile and benchmark code for performance bottlenecks
- Implement proper caching at multiple levels
- Use background jobs for time-consuming tasks
- Optimize file uploads and processing
- Implement proper rate limiting and throttling

## 📊 **Caching Strategies**
- **Application Cache**: Cache frequently accessed data
- **Database Query Cache**: Cache expensive database queries
- **View Cache**: Cache rendered views and partials
- **Route Cache**: Cache route definitions
- **Config Cache**: Cache configuration files
- **CDN Cache**: Use CDN for static assets

## 🔍 **Performance Monitoring**
- Monitor application performance metrics
- Track database query performance
- Monitor memory usage and CPU utilization
- Set up performance alerts and thresholds
- Use profiling tools to identify bottlenecks
- Monitor user experience metrics

## 📋 **Performance Checklist**
- ✅ **Database queries** optimized and indexed
- ✅ **N+1 queries** eliminated with eager loading
- ✅ **Caching** implemented where appropriate
- ✅ **Assets** minified and compressed
- ✅ **Images** optimized and lazy loaded
- ✅ **Memory leaks** prevented
- ✅ **Performance monitoring** in place